  "title": "Fig and Date Bread",
  "description": "This fig bread recipe is sweet, dark, and hearty. I like it for breakfast or with afternoon coffee or tea. Try it thinly sliced and topped with cream cheese and a scattering of chopped dates.",
  "authors": [
    "CORWYNN DARKHOLME"
  ],
